      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Imagine living in a society that spares the innocent and punishes the guilty, rather than the opposite.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052080122098786478",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T17:36:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Something something 'fair share'. \ud83d\ude43\n\n\nElon Musk (@elonmusk)\n\nI have paid over $10B in taxes in a single year, more than anyone in history. \n\nIf I exercise and sell stock options, the combined federal and state income tax is ~45% (I still pay California taxes for every day I spend there). \n\nThen there is another 40% tax paid on my estate when I die.\n\nOverall, I will probably end up paying trillions in taxes.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/elonmusk/status/2052126760633040977#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052163553147134039",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T23:08:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The incidence of pronouns in social media bios and email signatures is down at least 70% since the peak in 2020.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052095258209517643",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T18:36:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Going to the gym won't solve all of your problems but it's a good start.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052007632513241554",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T12:48:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Some people are just unhappy regardless of their situation. \n\nTrying to make someone who is fundamentally unhappy happy is a fool's errand. They have to consciously make the decision and change for themselves.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051774910029074665",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T21:23:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I'm amused by people who think rich people don't pay taxes.\n\nI don't even know where that idea came from.\n\nIt's not just false, it's an anti-truth.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051757308405858336",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T20:13:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Everything will work out in the long run... Things will change and there will be disruption, as always, but humanity isn't going anywhere.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051756436963618932",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T20:10:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A huge black pill is realising that millions of Millennials and Gen Z didn't even make it out their mother's womb.\n\nBeyond sad.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051734879293886636",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T18:44:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Looks like another trip to Austin, Texas is on the cards this month.",
